        "I am terrified and feel trapped. My daughter is often at work or busy with the children, and I haven't had the courage to \ntell her about the abuse. I am afraid of causing a rift in their marriage or being forced to leave and having nowhere to go. \nI feel ashamed and helpless, and my health is deteriorating further due to the constant stress and fear.",
